<Base title="Decision Explorer" description="Explore meaningful product choices, compare consequences and save a branching decision path without executing anything."><h1>Choose a<br/>{' '}starting point.</h1><p class="lede">Compare possible paths and their trade-offs. The agent can suggest defaults. These choices do not deploy, spend money or change permissions.</p><p>Looking for working tools and recent releases? <a href="/discover">Explore App Composer</a>.</p><div class="workbench"><section><div class="actions"><button id="default" class="secondary">Let the agent choose safe defaults</button><button id="clear" class="secondary">Clear this path</button></div><div id="questions"></div><details><summary>Explore App Composer’s next demonstration</summary><p>This is a proposed owner decision, saved locally. It does not update issues or execute a build.</p><label>What should the next demonstration prove?<select id="owner-priority"><option value="">Defer</option><option value="composition">Independent apps exchanging actions (recommended)</option><option value="onboarding">A new user’s verified environment</option><option value="encrypted-state">Fictional encrypted assistant portability</option></select></label><p id="owner-help" class="small"></p></details><p id="save-status" class="save-status" role="status" hidden></p><p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="message"></p></section><aside class="sticky ink"><h2>Your decision path</h2><div id="summary"></div><p class="small note">When you change an earlier answer, the spec keeps choices that still apply. Buying a new domain requires your approval.</p><div class="actions"><button id="use">Use in Init</button><button id="export" class="secondary">Download decisions</button></div><p id="branch-blocker" aria-live="polite"></p></aside></div><script src="../lib/explorer-client.ts"></script></Base>
